rem PlayTicTacToe.bbj
rem Part of the possible solution for the bonus exercise Make your Tic-Tac-Toe object-oriented, written for the Introduction to BBj Development book
rem The launcher only starts the game: it creates a GameWindow, shows it and waits for events. Run this file.

use ::GameWindow.bbj::GameWindow

declare GameWindow game!

game! = new GameWindow()
game!.show()

process_events
